"Each translation on new line, translations separated by colon : (escape character for colon is #:).<br>You can use also aliases in the translation. There is also special alias _#0, which contain matching text - following translation is perfectly OK:<br><code> Bio:&lt;img src=\"_#0.jpg\"&gt; ({publish_date....})</code><br>You can also use Regular Expressions - in such case the line would be \"<code>:regexp:<regular expression>:<output></code>\". You can use _#0 alias in <output>, which contains whole matching text.<br>Sometimes you want to remove specific value. In such case use <code>AA_NULL</code> text as translated text:<br> <code>Bio:AA_NULL</code><br>You may want also create more than one value from a value. Then separate the values by colon:<br> <code>Bio:Environment:Ecology</code> (\"Bio\" is replaced by two values). You can use any number of values here." => "Ka\x9Ed\xFD preklad na novom riadku, preklady oddelen\xE9 dvojbodkou : (escape znak pre dvojbodku je #:).<br>V preklade m\xF4\x9Eete pou\x9Ei\x9D aj aliasy. Existuje tie\x9E \x9Apeci\xE1lny alias _#0, ktor\xFD obsahuje n\xE1jden\xFD text - nasleduj\xFAci preklad je teda \xFAplne v poriadku:<br><code> Bio:&lt;img src=\"_#0.jpg\"&gt; ({publish_date....})</code><br>M\xF4\x9Eete pou\x9Ei\x9D aj regul\xE1rne v\xFDrazy - v takom pr\xEDpade m\xE1 riadok tvar \"<code>:regexp:<regular expression>:<output></code>\". V <output> m\xF4\x9Eete pou\x9Ei\x9D alias _#0, ktor\xFD obsahuje cel\xFD n\xE1jden\xFD text.<br>Niekedy potrebujete ur\xE8it\xFA hodnotu odstr\xE1ni\x9D. V takom pr\xEDpade pou\x9Eite ako preklad text <code>AA_NULL</code>:<br> <code>Bio:AA_NULL</code><br>Z jednej hodnoty m\xF4\x9Eete tie\x9E vytvori\x9D viac hodn\xF4t. Hodnoty potom odde\xBEte dvojbodkou:<br> <code>Bio:Environment:Ecology</code> (\"Bio\" sa nahrad\xED dvoma hodnotami). Po\xE8et hodn\xF4t nie je obmedzen\xFD.", // ai 2026-06

